category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgfortran5 libopenmpifh40
sdesc: "Object-oriented Fortran Unit-testing (runtime)"
ldesc: "Zofu (Zofu is Object-oriented Fortran Unit-testing) is a framework for
carrying out unit testing of Fortran code modules. As the name suggests, it
makes use of the object-oriented features of Fortran 2003."
external-source: zofu

